Short:        Amiga port of Mojon Twins 8 bits game
Author:       Tom & Birra
Uploader:     amigawave gmail com
Type:         game/jump
Version:      1.1
Architecture: m68k-amigaos => 1.2
Distribution: Aminet

For all Amiga computers with 512Kb.

It's a new free Amiga game release in 2018. This game port start as an
internal exercise learning how to make a direct port form C sources to Amiga
Blitz Basic.
 
Sir Ababol is an original game designed by Mojon Twins for 8 bits computers
and NES. http://www.mojontwins.com/juegos_mojonos/sir-ababol/

Code Birra and Tom.
Music by Zoltar.

Goblins 2018.

Update 1.1, add fire button for jump.
